   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.001",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Work and trust go together. Make your intention clear, break the goal into a step small enough to do this week, start it, ask Allah for success in your own words, and accept the result calmly. Allah says a person gets what he strives for, and tells us to consult others, and once we have decided, to rely on Him."
   },
