  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.002",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Trust in Allah is not sitting still. The Prophet said that if you relied on Allah as He should be relied on, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds, which leave in the morning empty and come back full. They go out and work. Plan, act, then place the result with Allah, who is enough for the one who relies on Him."
   },
   "ageBand": ["all"],
