  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.003",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "When motivation is low, shrink the task until it is almost too small to refuse: one page, five minutes, one phone call. Begin it, and let the habit carry you. The Prophet said that the deeds Allah loves most are the regular ones, even if small. Steady beats strong."
   },
