  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.004",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "When you cannot decide, do three things: gather facts and ask people who know the matter, pray the two rak'ahs of istikhara and ask Allah for what is best, then choose and move forward. Allah says that once you have decided, you rely on Him. You do not need a dream or a sign."
   },
