  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.faq.001",
   "kind": "faq",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "If a plan fails or a door closes, that is allowed to hurt, and it is also not the end of the road. Learn what you can, adjust, and try again. Allah says He brings about what He wills and has set a measure for everything, and that whoever relies on Him, He is enough for him."
   },
