   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.005",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Ordinary work becomes worship when it is done with a good intention. The Prophet said that deeds are by intentions. Earning to look after your family, studying to be useful, caring for a parent, each can be for Allah. Allah says He made us to worship Him, and worship is wider than the prayer mat."
   },
