  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.006",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Make dua for your goal and keep making it. The Prophet said your dua is answered as long as you are not impatient and say that you called and it was not answered. Ask for what you want, ask for what is best, and keep working. Allah is near and answers the one who calls."
   },
