  {
   "id": "goals_and_purpose.howto.007",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "A simple way to set goals for your deen: choose one prayer to improve, one small portion of Qur'an you will read, one short remembrance you will say each day, and one kind act each week. Keep it so small you cannot fail, hold it for a month, then add one more thing. Allah says to turn to Him with longing when you have finished your duties."
   },
